/* ══════════ §164 — A WELL ADDS TOWARD FULLNESS, NOT PAST IT (a dial: `poolsTowardFull`) ══════════ */
// ⬜ Aevi 2026-09-11 (§1): additive on a bounded scale, a well on rich ground is PUNISHED for being there — the Great Engine (0.98 +0.22)
