/* ══════════ §31D — THE DOMAIN IS A HEADING, AND THE SHEET NEVER SAYS IT ══════════ */
// ⛔ RULING (Aevi): the domain shows on the LEARN SCREEN as a grouping and NOWHERE a player identifies
